          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "note:004",
          "type": "note",
          "source_text": "The father immediately notices what is written on the cardboard sign. The more common expression is 不骄不躁, \"bu jiao bu zao\" (neither arrogant nor impatient).",
